From: X-WRT <dev@x-wrt.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: phylink: backport PCS lifetime and capability fixes from v21

Backport the v21 PCS provider changes onto the existing 6.18 PCS framework.
Protect PCS-to-phylink references with RCU, detach before freeing phylink,
and serialize provider notifications with PHY and phylink state updates.
Recalculate capabilities on attach/removal and preserve user-disabled
advertising across temporary PCS loss and SFP interface selection.

Retain the 6.18 PHY/SFP APIs and update its pauseparam setter's saved PHY
advertisement. Keep the current MAC and PCS consumer interfaces.

Upstream-author: Christian Marangi <ansuelsmth@gmail.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20261116163412.551438-1-ansuelsmth@gmail.com
Signed-off-by: X-WRT <dev@x-wrt.com>
---
